          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ak Goliat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiiyum anyun Pilistik lugosiekwak koba luget, ak kiiyumgei eng’ Soko, ne bo Juda, ak kiteech kwenutab Soko ak Aseka, eng’ Epes-damin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyumgei bikab Israel koboto Saul, ak kiteech atebwetab Ela, ak kotet luget kobargei ak Pilistik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitonone Pilistik tulwet komosta age, kotonone Israel tulwet komosta age: ak kimi atebwet kwenunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimong’ nyiganet age eng’ nganasetab Pilistik, ne kigiguure Goliat, ne bo Gat, ne ki koindanyi ko ki kakwautik lo che bo eut ak inchisiek sogol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitinyei kutwet ne bo sugunwet eng’ metinnyi, ak kiilaachi ngoriet ne bo karik; ak nyigisindab ngorionoto ko ki sekelisiek elfusiek mut che bo sugunonik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitinyei karikab sugunonik eng’ kelyekyik, ak ndiritab sugunwet eng’ batennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ki kergei irumetab ndirinnyi ak ketit ne taachin usisiek chito ne nabisiei; ak meleitab ng’otinnyi ko ki sekelisiek bogol lo che bo karik nyigisindanyi: ak kiwendi chito ne kiipchin long’et kondoe inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitonon ak kotwekyi lugosiekab Israel eng’ kutit ne o, kolenji, Amu nee si omong’u otet lugeng’wong’? Ma a Pilistindet, ko o otwogikab Saul? Olewenjige chito, ak ongochorgei konyonja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngot komuch kebarge tuwai, ak kobaran, keegu anyun otwogikwok: ago ngot aterter inendet, ak abar, oegu anyun otwogikyok, ak ootech. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Pilistindonoto, Arenye lugosiekab Israel ra; ogona chito, si kobiit kebarge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogas Saul ak Israel tugul ng’alechato bo Pilistindet, kotoptobenso, ak koiyweis mising’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ko ki weritab Epratindonoto bo Bet-lehem-juda, ne kainennyi ko ki Jesii; ak kitinyei werik sisiit: ak ki boiyot chichoto eng’ betusiekab Saul, kiga koosit eng’ kwenutab bik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiga ba luget werik che eechen somogu che bo Jesii kosub Saul: ak kainaikab werikyik somok che kiga ba luget ko ki Eliab, taita, ak ne rubei inendet ko Abinadab, ak ne bo somok ko Sama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ki ne ming’in Daudi: ak kiga isub Saul che eechen somogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwendi Daudi oldab Saul, ak koweeksei koyagi kechirekab kwandanyi eng’ Bet-lehem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kirigu Pilistindet karon ak koskoleny, ak koborugei eng’ betusiek artam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jesii werinnyi Daudi, Ipchi tupchosieguk epah agenge ne bo bek che kagigel, ak makatinichu taman, ak iipchi tupchosieguk eng’ nganaset, ichaktae; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak iipchi mugunichu taman bo chego kiptaiyatab elfunywa, ak igeer ole chamdoigei tupchosieguk, ak iibu wolunenywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi Saul, ak ichek, koboto bik tugul che bo Israel, atebwetab Ela, kobaregei ak Pilistik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’eet Daudi karon mising’, ak kobagakyi kechirek ribindet, ak kiib tuguchoto ak kwo, ko u ye kiga ng’at Jesii; ak kiit ole mi karisiek, ye kiwaachei luget agobo boriet, komachei komanda koba koyai luget. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitet luget Israel ak Pilistik, kotorjingei lugosiek tuwai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibagakyi Daudi tugukyik ribindetab tuguk, ak kolabat ye mi luget, kwo kogat werik che tupcho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kita kong’alaldos ak ichek, ogeero, kotogos nyiganet, Pilistindet ne bo Gat, ne kainennyi ko ki Goliat, komong’une kweanaikab Pilistik, ak komwa ng’alek che cham komwaei: ak kigas Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer bik tugul che bo Israel chichoto, komwee inendet, ak koiywei kot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile bikab Israel, Kaogeer chichi katogos? Katogosu iman konyo korenyei Israel: ak chito ne barei inendet, kogochin laitoriat inendet magornatet ne o, ak kogochi cheptanyi kotun, ak kotiach gotab kwandanyi eng’ Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji Daudi bik che kitonondos eng’ ye mi inendet, kolenji, Kiyachin nee chito ne barei Pilistindoni, ak koisto tewernatani eng’ Isrtael? Amu ng’o Pilistindoni ma kimuratan, kot koreny lugosiekab Kamuktaindet ne sobei? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwolji bichoto inendet ko u ni, kolenji, Kiyachin ko u noto chito ne barei inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigas Eliab ng’etab kamet ne o kong’alaljin bichoto; ak kilalyo neregekab Eliab agobo Daudi, ak kile, Amu nee si ichoruge? Ak kebagakyi ng’o kechirechoto ng’ering’ eng’ ong’atet? Angen menoteng’ung’, ak yaitietab muguleldang’ung’; amu kechoruge inyo igeer luget.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Daudi, Kawech nee nguno? Tos mami kiy ne bo bani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwelelgei kotokyigei chito age, ak komwa ko u atgai: ak kiwolji bik inendet kogeny ko u tai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingegas ng’alek che kimwa Daudi, keba kemwachi Saul; ak kiyokto chito koguur inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Daudi Saul, Amat kome chi mugulel agobo inendet; wendi otwogindeng’ung’ kobaregei ak Pilistindonito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Saul Daudi, Memuchi iwe obargei ak Pilistindonito: amu ta ko i ming’in, ak inendet ko chitab luget koboch ming’inatennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Daudi Saul, Kiiyagi otwogindeng’ung’ kechirekab kwandanyi; ak kingonyo ng’etundo, anan tiondo age ne kergei ak keerit, ak konam aruetab kechir eng’ akwet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asub, awe abar, ak asoru eng’ kutinnyi: ak kingong’eet kole kobara, anam tamnet, akwer, ak abar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibar otwogindeng’ung’ tiong’ichoto tuwai, ng’etundo ak noto ne kergei ak keerit; ak igeitu Pilistindonito ma kimuratan age eng’ ichek, amu kogoreny lugosiekab Kamuktaindet ne sobei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwa Daudi kole, Jehovah ne kisorua eng’ siokab ng’etundo, ak eng’ siokab tionyoto, kosorua eng’ eutab Pilistindoni. Ak kilenji Saul Daudi, Ui, ak mi Jehovah koboten. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiilaakyi Saul Daudi ngoriennyi ne bo luget, ak kogerjine metit kutwetab sugunwet, ak kiilaakyi ngorietab karik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiratyi Daudi ngoriennyi rotwennyi bo chok, kolen kwo; amu kitom kotiem. Ak kilenji Daudi Saul, Mamuchi aib tuguchu; amu tom atiem. Ak kiireek Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinam kiroktanyi, ak kokwechigei kibargook mut eng’ kererut, ak konde loletab mestowek ne kitinyei, noto ko ki suberennyi; ak kimi eunnyi borowet ne kiwirtoe koita: ak kirikyi Pilistindet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyo Pilistindet korikyi Daudi; ak kiindoe inendet chito ne kiipchin long’et. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeerot Pilistindet ola tugul, kogeer Daudi, ak kosas: amu kita ko ming’in, ak ki birir, ak kotinyei toget ne kararan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Pilistindet Daudi, Tos a seset kot inyonja ak kirokwek? Ak kichub Pilistindonoto Daudi eng’ kanamonikyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Pilistindet Daudi, Nyo ole ami, si kobiit agochi bortang’ung’ taritikab barak, ak tiong’ikab timin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo kolenji Daudi Pilistindonoto, Kenyonja ak rotwetab chok, ak ng’otit, ak ndirit: ago kanyonjin eng’ kainetab Jehovah ne bo lugosiek, Kamuktaindetab lugosiekab Israel, ne koireny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indein rani Jehovah eunnyu; ak awirin, ak atil meting’ung’, ak agochi rani muswekab lugetab Pilistik taritik che bo barak, ak tiong’ikab timin che bo ng’ony; si kobiit konai ng’ony tugul kole, mi Kamuktaindet Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak si kobiit konai tuiyoni tugul kole, masorune chi Jehovah rotwetab chok ak ng’otit: amu bo luget Jehovah ak indeok eunekyok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingong’eet Pilistindet konyo korik, kotorok Daudi, kochakta Daudi, kolabat kotokyigei ole mi luget kotorokta Pilistindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiirooch Daudi eut lolennyi, ak konem koita, konde borowet, ak kowir Pilistindet kokwer turietab toget; ak kichut koita toget orit, ak kiibut kondoe met. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koterter anyun Daudi Pilistindet eng’ borowonoto bo koita, kiwir Pilistindet ak kobar inendet; ago kima komi rotwo ne bo chok eutab Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolabat anyun Daudi, kwo kotonone Pilistindet, ak konam rotwetab Pilistindonoto, kong’us eng’ choget, ak kobar, ak koebe kaatit kong’et. Ak kingogeer Pilistik kole kagome nyiganennywa, komwei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’eetyo bikab Israel ak che bo Juda, ak kowaach, ak koon Pilistik, agoi koit Gat, agoi kurgotikab Ekron. Ak kiibutyot eng’ oret ne wendi Saaraim Pilistik che kigiguoten, agoi Gat, ak Ekron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiweek lagokab Israel eng’ onet ne kionei Pilistik, ak konyaban nganasenywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiib Daudi metitab Pilistindonoto, konyo Jerusalem; ago kigonore emainnyi karikab Pilistindet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer Saul Daudi kowendi kobaregei ak Pilistindet, koteebe Abner ne ki kiptaiyatab luget, kolenji, Abner, bo gab ng’o weri? Ak kile Abner, Ko u ye sobei sobondang’ung’, ee laitoriat, ko mangen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 17:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile laitoriat, Teeb ole bo werito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.17.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.17.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
